- check EXT_color_buffer_float? Use RGBA8 textures — fine without float ext. Normals in RGBA8 lose precision but acceptable. Better: use RGBA16F with EXT_color_buffer_float if available, fallback RGBA8. Keep simple: RGBA8.
- Create FBO with two color attachments + depth renderbuffer.
- Geometry pass program from gbuffer shaders; light pass program.
- Sphere VAO; fullscreen triangle VAO.
- Lights: 3 lights with positions/colors.
- state params: { exposure: 1, intensity: 1.5, lightCount: 3 }
- render(): update camera angle by time; draw geometry to FBO; then light pass to default framebuffer.
- capture(): render then canvas.toDataURL? Actually capture in controls: canvas.toBlob → download. Since preserveDrawingBuffer: true, toDataURL works anytime. Return dataURL from api.capture().
- getStats(): { lightCount, exposure }.

setParams(p): merge into params.

