```js
function perspective(fovy, aspect, near, far) {...}
function lookAt(eye, center, up) {...}
function multiply(a,b) {...}
```

Column-major mat4 as Float32Array(16).

Geometry pass: bind FBO, viewport, clear, use gbuffer program, set uMVP/uModel, draw sphere indexed.

Light pass: bindFramebuffer null, use light program, bind textures to units 0,1,2, set uniforms, draw fullscreen triangle (3 verts).

Camera: angle = time*0.0005; eye = [sin(a)*3, 1.2, cos(a)*3].

Model = identity. uMVP = proj*view.

capture(): return canvas.toDataURL('image/png').

